{
  "title": "Contoso APM \u2014 Business values",
  "description": "Checkout business labels: tracking_id, lane, weight_kg, quote_price.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 48,
        "h": 8
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "How to demo",
        "content": "## Contoso business values on APM transactions\n\nCheckout sets Elastic APM labels / numeric_labels via `ApmBusiness.SetCheckoutLabels`:\n\n| Field | ES field | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| Tracking id | `labels.tracking_id` | `DEMO-082522-8011` |\n| Lane | `labels.lane` | `DXB-AMM`, `SLOW` |\n| Weight (kg) | `numeric_labels.weight_kg` | `12` |\n| Quote price | `numeric_labels.quote_price` | `27.51` |\n\n**In APM UI:** open `POST Checkout/Index` \u2192 **Metadata \u2192 Labels**.\n\nEDOT TrackingApi also tags `tracking_id` / `shipment_status` on span attributes.\n",
        "settings": {
          "open_links_in_new_tab": true
        }
      },
      "id": "83f0afc2-6b12-4ec3-a29e-e6e45f873453",
      "type": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "config": {
        "type": "metric",
        "title": "Labeled checkouts (24h)",
        "sampling": 1,
        "ignore_global_filters": false,
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM traces-apm-default | WHERE @timestamp > NOW() - 24 hours AND processor.event == \"transaction\" AND labels.tracking_id IS NOT NULL | STATS docs = COUNT(*)"
        },
        "styling": {
          "density": "default",
          "primary": {
            "position": "bottom",
            "labels": {
              "alignment": "left"
            },
            "value": {
              "alignment": "right",
              "sizing": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "column": "docs",
            "type": "primary",
            "color": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "id": "54b90fe3-edc2-43f7-b1d3-d550929bf80c",
      "type": "vis"
    },
